#2)  Apllying them will unblind, unconfuse, unhallucinate, I think unsick you.
It will also clear up a potion of sickness if dipped into it.  It will also
restore stats that have been lowered.  When "you feel good" you have had a
stat restored (if I remember correctly)

#3)  Wraiths, if they leave a corpse, can be eaten to raise your character one
level.  They have (I think) no food value (perhaps one)...

as for dragon mail...

Zap it once with the wand.  ONLY once.  Then you will get dragon scale mail.
Perhaps there is some little thing I don't know about, but it always works for
me.  If you zap it twice, it will change to dragon mail, then some other kind
of armor....

